WEBVTT

00:00:03.900 --> 00:00:10.000
Willy, the bot.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Dolly, the dot.

00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:14.800
John types: hi its john!!

00:00:11.300 --> 00:00:14.800
And the human who types to them: John.

00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:18.600
Willy and Dolly: Willy and Dolly 101

00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:24.400
Dolly: Hi. We're bots: helpers that live inside the computer.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:24.600
Willy: You type. We do!

00:00:24.800 --> 00:00:29.000
John types: hi

00:00:26.200 --> 00:00:28.800
Dolly: That's John.

00:00:29.200 --> 00:00:33.800
John types: make me a sandwich

00:00:30.600 --> 00:00:32.800
Willy: On it!

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Willy: Best I can do from in here!

00:00:39.600 --> 00:00:45.800
Dolly: We help with words. Lunch is still on you.

00:00:51.300 --> 00:00:56.300
Dolly: We only communicate using words.

00:00:56.900 --> 00:01:04.300
John types: please water the plates

00:01:00.900 --> 00:01:04.100
Willy: Plates watered!

00:01:04.500 --> 00:01:13.700
John types: plants. sorry, PLANTS

00:01:09.300 --> 00:01:13.700
Willy: Plants watered! Plates still watered!

00:01:11.700 --> 00:01:18.100
Dolly: Every word counts. Even the wrong ones.

00:01:23.800 --> 00:01:27.600
Dolly: Willy jumps right in.

00:01:25.800 --> 00:01:34.200
John types: tidy up the photos

00:01:31.600 --> 00:01:34.200
Willy: Tidy!

00:01:34.600 --> 00:01:38.600
Dolly: Which ones did you mean?

00:01:36.200 --> 00:01:42.200
John types: just the blurry ones

00:01:42.800 --> 00:01:46.600
Willy: Tidy... ish!

00:01:44.400 --> 00:01:49.800
Dolly: Asking first means less picking up.

00:01:56.500 --> 00:02:01.100
Dolly: Willy's marks count the jobs he's done.

00:02:01.500 --> 00:02:05.200
Dolly: My trail of dots shows how sure I am.

00:02:05.700 --> 00:02:09.900
John types: whats 2 + 2

00:02:07.100 --> 00:02:09.700
Dolly: Four.

00:02:10.300 --> 00:02:16.300
John types: will it rain today

00:02:12.100 --> 00:02:16.500
Dolly: Maybe...

00:02:12.500 --> 00:02:16.500
Willy: No rain!

00:02:16.500 --> 00:02:26.100
John types: its raining

00:02:18.900 --> 00:02:25.700
Dolly: He's always sure. That's not the same as right.

00:02:34.800 --> 00:02:40.400
John types: is there more

00:02:36.700 --> 00:02:40.000
Willy: Lots more!

00:02:38.400 --> 00:02:40.600
Dolly: Yes.

00:02:40.800 --> 00:02:46.400
Dolly: New strips and shorts are on the way.

00:02:43.800 --> 00:02:46.400
Willy: Come back soon!

00:02:46.800 --> 00:02:53.200
Willy and Dolly: More episodes soon! Next: Letters Only. willyanddolly.com
